cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use the human-readable Health-RI Metadata Model specification,
  please cite it using the metadata in preferred-citation. For the
  Health-RI Metadata Model's machine-readable schema artifacts,
  cite the health-ri-metadata repository
  (https://github.com/Health-RI/health-ri-metadata).

title: Health-RI Metadata Documentation

abstract: >-
  This repository maintains the human-readable technical specification
  of the Health-RI Metadata Model for the National Health Data Catalogue.
  The specification describes metadata classes, properties, cardinalities,
  controlled vocabularies, and usage guidance to support consistent
  implementation and interoperability.

authors:
  - name: Stichting Health-RI

version: v2.1.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Health-RI/metadata-documentation
license: CC-BY-4.0

